# Working in Aura

A cinematic digital biography. Next.js 16 App Router, one app, no monorepo. Dark
editorial design: grayscale, serif display type, monospace labels, generous
negative space. Read `architecture.md`, `plan.md`, `api.md`, and `phase.md`
before structural changes.

